{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 無事初日の幕が開きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝、各メディアで記者会見の様子や公開ゲネプロの様子がたくさん取り上げられてたらしいです、本当にありがたい(・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何より創作落語が無事終えられたことが一安心。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、まんじゅうこわいのパロディ 「まんじゅうこわすぎる」をやりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年より成長出来てたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーム「ら」\n私は今回このチームで本当に良かったなって思う\nもっと良くしようもっと良くしようっていう向上心の塊な5人。\n千秋楽まであと4公演あるから1公演1公演を大切に駆け抜けたいと思っておる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2016/05/13/2483042/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても今更ですが\nこの間の京都全握と個握です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは全握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2016/05/13/2483042/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかさくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか好きー(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2016/05/13/2483042/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"muruaのオールインワン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2016/05/13/2483042/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部はお団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15日も握手会があるからその時にじょしらくの感想とかも聞けるのかな(o^^o)\n楽しみにしてます！！"},{"type":"break"},